# A deep mod's compiled output lives beside the mod now (premake5.lua points the
# mod_<id> projects' targetdir/objdir into their own folder, per configuration and
# platform). *.lib, *.pdb and *.exp are covered above; the obj/ and lib/ trees and
# MSVC's .idb incremental-build database are not, and would litter git status.
